/* Normally generated (and gitignored) by the Expo CLI on first `expo start` /
   `expo prebuild`. Committed here instead: this sandbox has no simulator to run
   the CLI against, and — with `experiments.typedRoutes` left off in
   app.config.ts (nothing here needs generated route types yet) — this
   reference line is 100% static, so tracking it costs nothing and lets
   `tsc --noEmit` run in CI with no CLI step first. Revisit if typed routes are
   turned on later: that path DOES need to stay gitignored and regenerated. */
